            "detailed_description": "<h1>Note from develpers</h1><p>Hello everyone, I am going to make this game free! (Waiting for the response from Steamsupport).\r\n\r\nTo not run out of money for dedicated servers I have changed the network model to a listen host. Now you can host the game through the menu, and other people will find you.\r\nAnd because I never reached budget to deliver whole ColdpSace story, I am just adding last level called Heaven. If you want, I can tell you our original idea in our discord channel.\r\nGood luck, spacemen!\r\n\r\nPS You also can unlock all achievements in training mode, playing with bots ;)</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Fast deadly and really fun. Participate in a huge space conflict based on a Cold War with your teammates.\r\nFair fights, where only your skill and speed does matter.\r\n\r\n- Every shot is a potential kill.\r\n- Fast respawn for unstoppable process.\r\n- Melee weapon makes you more deadly in a close combat.\r\n- Use the force-field, if you would like to life a little longer.\r\n- Watch radar to cover your back.\r\n- Use double jump mechanics to take advantage on a battlefield.\r\n- Grab pickups dropped on the level, to make yourself more dangerous: rapid-fire, wallhack, speedhack, quad-jump and improved force-field.\r\n- Customize your spaceman with a looted outfits.\r\n\r\nEarth's orbit, Mars and Venus could become your grave. Try to survive.",
            "about_the_game": "Fast deadly and really fun. Participate in a huge space conflict based on a Cold War with your teammates.<br />\r\nFair fights, where only your skill and speed does matter.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Every shot is a potential kill.<br />\r\n- Fast respawn for unstoppable process.<br />\r\n- Melee weapon makes you more deadly in a close combat.<br />\r\n- Use the force-field, if you would like to life a little longer.<br />\r\n- Watch radar to cover your back.<br />\r\n- Use double jump mechanics to take advantage on a battlefield.<br />\r\n- Grab pickups dropped on the level, to make yourself more dangerous: rapid-fire, wallhack, speedhack, quad-jump and improved force-field.<br />\r\n- Customize your spaceman with a looted outfits.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEarth's orbit, Mars and Venus could become your grave. Try to survive.",
            "short_description": "Fast team-based one-shot-one-kill shooter. Cold War gave a start for a huge conflict in space. Grab your knife and pistol, turn on your force-field and fight in the name of your motherland. But is it possible to survive for more than ten seconds in this slaughter?",
